      "trigger": "a developer pushes a commit to a branch",
      "action": "complete build, static analysis, unit and integration tests and security scanning within {{MAX_PIPELINE_MINUTES}} minutes, parallelising or tiering slower suites as needed",
      "rationale": "Slow pipelines push developers to batch commits and context-switch away, which delays feedback on regressions and inflates the size of every change."
